        "Description": "Hello 47\r\rYour target is former ICA agent Maslin Grenier. Grenier was one of our most prominent prospects in the agency, until his infamous motor accident. The accident left his memory scrabbled, and wiped all prior knowledge about his profession. This left a crisis within the ICA, in which the board concluded that Grenier was a potential liability, since along with his memory, his loyalty was tarnished. Thus the ICA has allowed Greniers penultimate retirement.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare 47.",
